Server init.
>> a := Blob nyowani: 4.
a bytes: ( Rondedzero nyowani ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nyowani: 4.
b bytes: ( Rondedzero nyowani ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a nyowani.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Zvabuda nyora: ['xorred:'], mutsara-mutsva. 
Zvabuda nyora: n, mutsara-mutsva. 
} bata: { :e Zvabuda nyora: e, mutsara-mutsva. }, tanga.
a sunungura.
b sunungura.
